What was that?
I don't know.

951
01:01:01,125 --> 01:01:04,333
What's happening?
We're running
out of gas!

952
01:01:04,333 --> 01:01:06,500
Cici!
We're out of gas?

953
01:01:06,500 --> 01:01:09,500
